  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>. Then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>21</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is______."
  },
